         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lowpass filter for constant force effect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Applies only to the CF effect (usually covers all physics based forces for most games) and interpolated between updates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use this filter to tune between sharp and smooth forces and to reduce noise. &lt;br/&gt;Frequency should be lower than games FFB update speed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
